    "summary": "Scans Kalshi's KXBTC15M 15-minute Bitcoin markets using a coarse-to-fine orderbook search to pinpoint the At-The-Money (ATM) strike. It targets contract sides trading at extreme discount price thresholds (<= 4\u00a2 risk), capping downside to pennies while maintaining up to 25x asymmetric payout potential if BTC breaks target before settlement.",
