    "summary": "Subscribes to real-time Kraken Level 3 (L3) WebSocket feeds to compute Orderbook Imbalance (OBI) and detect institutional 'whale' orders (>= 15 BTC depth walls). It feeds these micro-structure signals into Kalshi 15m execution logic to pause buying into whale pressure walls and execute instant panic-sells if heavy order flow reverses against active positions.",
