    "id": "trade_btc_15m_cross_arb",
    "fileName": "trade_btc_15m_cross_arb.rs",
    "title": "Kalshi vs. Polymarket 15m Cross-Exchange Arbitrage",
    "badge": "Cross-Exchange Risk-Free Arb",
    "badgeColor": "bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300 border-amber-800/80",
    "summary": "Simultaneously streams real-time WebSocket orderbooks from both Kalshi and Polymarket for identical 15-minute Bitcoin strike events. It calculates exact fee-inclusive combined costs for opposing pairs (e.g., Kalshi YES + Polymarket NO) and triggers cross-market arbitrage signals whenever total entry cost falls below $1.00, locking in risk-free profit regardless of settlement outcome.",
